<section class="page-header">
<div class="container">
<p style="margin-bottom:8px;"><a href="/blog/" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);font-size:0.9rem;text-decoration:none;">&larr; Back to Blog</a></p>
<h1>Thanksgiving Travel: Book Your Holiday Rental Before the Rush</h1>
<p>Thanksgiving is November 26 &mdash; and it shares the week with deer opener. Here's how to lock in the right vehicle now.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section">
<div class="container">
<div style="max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;">
<p>Thanksgiving falls on <strong>Thursday, November 26</strong> this year. In Jackson County, that week also carries the opening days of the gun deer season &mdash; which means hunters, college kids coming home, and families hosting out-of-town relatives are all looking for vehicles at the same time. A month out is the right time to book.</p>
<h2>Match the vehicle to the holiday</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Picking up relatives or driving to Grandma's:</strong> a <a href="/fleet" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;">full-size car</a> ($65/day local, $85/day unlimited) is roomy and economical.</li>
<li><strong>Snow in the forecast or rural driveways:</strong> the <a href="winter-awd-rental-subaru-outback-black-river-falls.html" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;">AWD Subaru Outback or a Ford Edge SUV</a> ($80/day local, $100/day unlimited).</li>
<li><strong>Family of six plus pies:</strong> the <a href="7-passenger-minivan-rental-black-river-falls.html" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;">7-passenger minivan</a> ($78/day + $0.10/mile).</li>
<li><strong>The whole extended family to one table:</strong> the <a href="15-passenger-van-rental-cost-black-river-falls.html" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;">15-passenger van</a> ($135/day + $0.10/mile).</li>
</ul>
<h2>Take the whole week</h2>
<p>Holiday trips have a way of stretching &mdash; Wednesday pickup, Black Friday errands, the Sunday drive home. Every weekly rental includes unlimited miles: $450/week for the minivan, $750/week for the 15-passenger van, and $510/week unlimited for a full-size car. See <a href="weekly-car-rental-rates-when-7-days-beats-daily.html" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;">when weekly beats daily</a>.</p>
<h2>Plan around holiday hours</h2>
<p><strong>We're closed Thanksgiving Day, Thursday, November 26.</strong> Plan to pick up by Wednesday, and set a return for Friday or later. The rest of the week we're on our normal hours: Monday&ndash;Friday 8&ndash;5 and Saturday 8&ndash;noon, with Sunday by appointment. Line up your pickup and return times when you book and we'll make it work.</p>
<h2>Book now, not Tuesday</h2>
<p>The 15-passenger van and the AWD Outback are one-of-a-kind in our fleet, and both are in demand from hunters the same week. The week before Thanksgiving is too late for either. Call now and it's handled.</p>
<p><strong>Call or text 715-396-1466</strong> &mdash; family-owned in Black River Falls since 1983. Happy Thanksgiving from the Riverside crew.</p>
<div style="margin-top:48px;">
<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
<div class="faq-list">
<div class="faq-item">
<button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">When should I book a rental for Thanksgiving 2026?
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
</button>
<div class="faq-answer"><p>As early as possible. Thanksgiving is November 26, and the week overlaps the start of Wisconsin's gun deer season, so vans and AWD vehicles book up.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item">
<button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">Do weekly rentals include unlimited miles?
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
</button>
<div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. Weekly rentals of 7+ days include unlimited mileage on the unlimited rate: $450/week for the minivan, $750/week for the 15-passenger van.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item">
<button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">Are you open on Thanksgiving?
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
</button>
<div class="faq-answer"><p>No. We're closed Thanksgiving Day, Thursday, November 26. Pick up by Wednesday. Otherwise we keep normal hours: Monday&ndash;Friday 8&ndash;5, Saturday 8&ndash;noon, Sunday by appointment.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item">
<button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">What's the best rental for a big family Thanksgiving?
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
</button>
<div class="faq-answer"><p>The 7-passenger minivan fits most families with luggage; the 15-passenger van keeps a large extended family in one vehicle.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
